{
    "word": "gremlin",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                "word": "gremlin",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "960d4038-3e2a-47d7-a335-c4d0ea4ad6d9",
                        "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gremlins"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18bc2ce8-1f91-3e71-8ad1-63ba435799ef",
                        "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A contemptible person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1dd3f78a-fb7e-38f6-8478-37199a264a86",
                        "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An imaginary creature reputed to be mischievously inclined, for example, to damage or dismantle machinery."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e9e2c23-42ad-42dd-927b-60edbf236bda",
                                "sense_id": "1dd3f78a-fb7e-38f6-8478-37199a264a86",
                                "text": "Like Abominable Snowmen, gremlins have never actually been seen; but nobody who works with electronic gear doubts the existence of these mischievous and elusive entities. There are too many malfunctions and failures that can have no other explanation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bd14468-65b0-4b61-bb22-7404ce2a45ef",
                                "sense_id": "1dd3f78a-fb7e-38f6-8478-37199a264a86",
                                "text": "Crucial time was saved by the fact Nexus didn't require a Transport & Works Act. Nevertheless, other gremlins kept raising their heads."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ded27534-2861-379e-ba4e-9aebccfd0d60",
                        "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any mysterious, unknown source of mischief or trouble, or the problem created thereby."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aed88f74-416b-4dbf-bdd1-46ba2ac41e89",
                                "sense_id": "ded27534-2861-379e-ba4e-9aebccfd0d60",
                                "text": "We rechecked everything, and we suspect gremlins in the database."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "958a37c5-4616-3547-bd0c-744cf52d7325",
                        "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A young, inexperienced surfer or skateboarder, regarded as a nuisance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46333f25-9e37-3c37-ba35-925d2498363c",
                        "entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person regarded as similar to a fictional gremlin, in particular: mischievous, troublesome, short, or annoying."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecccc55f-5f10-43df-8939-7a6dce6aca59",
                                "sense_id": "46333f25-9e37-3c37-ba35-925d2498363c",
                                "text": "Rosa, the main character in Tears of Themis, is also very smart, justice-driven, and willing to help. Meanwhile, the Honkai: Star Rail Trailblazer […] can often be a sarcastic, pessimistic, lazy, self-serving, dumpster-diving gremlin."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "248846f5-a78a-47c1-9578-e3d775e20ef3",
                        "source_entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "source_sense_description": "imaginary creature reputed to be mischievously inclined to damage or dismantle machinery",
                        "target_lang_word": "гремлин",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "гремлин",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b61aaf58-633e-3ebd-9098-c4adefbd4b23",
                                        "entry_id": "217d9f84-307e-315e-a054-f41a1801ef3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "мифол. в английском фольклоре — проказливое фантастическое существо, вызывающее неисправности в самолётах или другой технике"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13969dc5-9c86-45ba-a41e-e7753b220f79",
                                                "sense_id": "b61aaf58-633e-3ebd-9098-c4adefbd4b23",
                                                "text": "И если, придя утром на работу, ты обнаружил отформатированный диск в своём компе, не спеши обвинять в злодеянии ближнего своего: вероятно, тебе нагадил гремлин."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c6f336d0-1c43-4d1b-a999-f47f5157cfd1",
                        "source_entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "source_sense_description": "any mysterious, unknown source of mischief or trouble, or the problem created thereby",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fehlerteufel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e59faee-5000-4021-9aec-2b4c8b485a66",
                        "source_entry_id": "a03f3842-2c69-344f-9783-7e4333f69da8",
                        "source_sense_description": "any mysterious, unknown source of mischief or trouble, or the problem created thereby",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kobold",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kobold",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                        "entry_id": "732c96c6-978e-3b5e-9a99-c23a51509e1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zwergenhaftes Geistwesen, das mit anderen Schabernack treibt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "872a9b9d-d4b4-4c1c-b1a5-7cd56e197ef1",
                                                "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                                "text": "Das Glück ist ein hinterhältiger Kobold: Es bereitet ihm offenbar größten Spaß, uns kurz vor dem Ziel noch rasch ein Bein zu stellen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7aa225d8-2cde-4499-900b-b9e019ea24d4",
                                                "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                                "text": "„Im Gegensatz zu dem schwerfälligen Kobold war sie von sprühender Intelligenz.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2aa0328-253d-4b05-b86b-9cc5bdd4c567",
                                                "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                                "text": "„Zunächst richteten die Kobolde keinen Schaden an.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4ec9f5b-8196-3f8b-9223-6b6719a974ca",
                                        "entry_id": "732c96c6-978e-3b5e-9a99-c23a51509e1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Blitz oberhalb einer Wolke"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92bbafd0-2f49-4230-8c51-39e2cd7ae701",
                                                "sense_id": "d4ec9f5b-8196-3f8b-9223-6b6719a974ca",
                                                "text": "Kobolde bekommt man nur selten zu sehen, obwohl sie ein sehr häufiges Phänomen sind."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
